WEBVTT

00:00:19.490 --> 00:00:26.040
<b>Chaika the Coffin Princess</b>

00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:26.790
<b>Chaika the Coffin Princess</b>

00:02:14.890 --> 00:02:15.740
Your Majesty.

00:02:16.420 --> 00:02:20.860
I have brought the assistant director of 
the Institute of Magic, Viktor Izhmash.

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:23.470
Izhmash.

00:02:23.470 --> 00:02:24.580
Y-Yes?

00:02:24.950 --> 00:02:31.140
I order you to produce the tools
 necessary to achieve my goal.

00:02:31.720 --> 00:02:34.590
We already have the technology and the plans.

00:02:35.430 --> 00:02:37.560
All that remains is to carry it out.

00:02:37.560 --> 00:02:38.210
Yes.

00:02:38.210 --> 00:02:42.800
However, it must be carried 
out in strictest secrecy.

00:02:44.180 --> 00:02:47.500
I have arranged a research center 
and funding outside the country.

00:02:47.890 --> 00:02:49.210
Begin immediately.

00:02:49.210 --> 00:02:49.970
Understood.

00:02:50.300 --> 00:02:54.730
There is one more thing you must know.

00:02:58.490 --> 00:02:59.640
"Chaika"?

00:03:00.010 --> 00:03:02.500
All will be set in motion for my sake.

00:03:02.970 --> 00:03:06.330
It may appear counterintuitive to that end,

00:03:06.330 --> 00:03:09.080
but that in itself is my intention.

00:03:10.970 --> 00:03:13.280
I will die soon.

00:03:14.450 --> 00:03:17.640
Five years ago, the eight heroes assembled by

00:03:17.640 --> 00:03:19.630
the Alliance of the Six Nations

00:03:19.630 --> 00:03:21.550
eliminated Emperor Gaz.

00:03:33.590 --> 00:03:39.440
This brought an end to the war 
that had raged for 300 years,

00:03:39.710 --> 00:03:43.120
but even now, five years after the war's end,

00:03:43.120 --> 00:03:46.560
the deceased Emperor Gaz, 
deemed the "taboo emperor,"

00:03:46.560 --> 00:03:49.450
maintains vast influence upon this continent.

00:03:50.910 --> 00:03:54.550
You say he was involved in the 
floating fortress incident, as well?

00:03:54.550 --> 00:03:55.250
Yes.

00:03:55.570 --> 00:03:57.660
It is safe to say that 
the emperor's remains and

00:03:57.660 --> 00:03:59.630
his daughter, Chaika, initiated the event.

00:04:01.300 --> 00:04:04.490
Isan, hizan, yadwavi, ama...

00:04:04.490 --> 00:04:06.600
Come, that which overwhelms!

00:04:07.310 --> 00:04:08.930
The Overwarming!

00:04:09.560 --> 00:04:13.060
The Princess Who Gathers the Remains

00:04:16.510 --> 00:04:18.930
Elum... Naikt inte... Naint...

00:04:18.130 --> 00:04:22.740
As you know, the floating fortress 
incident that occurred one month ago

00:04:23.080 --> 00:04:26.720
not only resulted in many deaths, 
including that of the general,

00:04:26.720 --> 00:04:30.240
but once again placed us in a 
war outbreak scenario.

00:04:30.710 --> 00:04:32.390
Blow, powerful gust!

00:04:32.390 --> 00:04:33.960
The Heavy Wind!

00:04:36.220 --> 00:04:40.970
Chief Konrad of the Kliemann Organization 
in charge of postwar restoration,

00:04:40.970 --> 00:04:42.740
give your report of the details.

00:04:42.740 --> 00:04:43.560
Yes, sir.

00:04:44.500 --> 00:04:48.080
Ricardo Gavarni, the son of Duke Gavarni,

00:04:48.080 --> 00:04:52.980
most likely used Emperor Gaz's remains 
to power the floating fortress.

00:04:52.980 --> 00:04:55.540
According to reports from 
our investigating team,

00:04:55.540 --> 00:04:59.970
the remains were obtained from 
a girl believed to be Chaika.

00:05:05.750 --> 00:05:07.330
Girls calling themselves Chaika

00:05:07.330 --> 00:05:09.680
began appearing throughout the continent

00:05:09.680 --> 00:05:11.740
three years after the war ended.

00:05:12.140 --> 00:05:14.420
Regardless of whether their claims are true,

00:05:14.420 --> 00:05:17.610
they all work toward the 
same goal of gathering

00:05:17.610 --> 00:05:21.150
the emperor's remains from the eight heroes.

00:05:21.550 --> 00:05:24.130
Are you really the daughter of Emperor Gaz?

00:05:24.360 --> 00:05:26.760
I am real! Real daughter!

00:05:26.760 --> 00:05:30.520
Your father was the most 
powerful wizard of all.

00:05:31.040 --> 00:05:32.850
Elum... Naikt inte... Naint...

00:05:33.550 --> 00:05:34.770
Bertolt... Infant...

00:05:35.460 --> 00:05:37.120
Come, swirling vortex!

00:05:37.120 --> 00:05:38.310
The Tornado!

00:05:42.940 --> 00:05:45.530
Shock... Incantation time, short...

00:05:52.410 --> 00:05:53.130
Chaika?!

00:05:54.660 --> 00:05:56.080
Elum... Kolt...

00:05:56.080 --> 00:05:57.870
Come, that which bursts and scatters!

00:05:58.090 --> 00:05:59.250
The Buster!

00:05:59.250 --> 00:05:59.920
Natow!

00:06:06.620 --> 00:06:08.220
They're former soldiers.

00:06:08.660 --> 00:06:10.500
What are they doing out here in the sticks?

00:06:11.180 --> 00:06:13.450
They're pretty good at handling weapons.

00:06:13.450 --> 00:06:14.360
Yeah.

00:06:16.150 --> 00:06:17.790
I am steel.

00:06:17.790 --> 00:06:20.960
Steel knows no fear. Steel knows no doubt.

00:06:20.960 --> 00:06:24.310
When faced with my enemy, I hesitate not.

00:06:24.310 --> 00:06:26.300
I am a weapon to destroy these.

00:06:26.750 --> 00:06:27.830
Iron-Blood Transformation!

00:06:39.710 --> 00:06:40.710
What?!

00:06:41.210 --> 00:06:42.970
That form...

00:06:42.970 --> 00:06:44.870
I've seen it on the battlefield!

00:06:44.870 --> 00:06:47.160
You're saboteurs of the Acura clan?!

00:06:47.160 --> 00:06:48.130
What of it?

00:06:48.760 --> 00:06:52.150
Why are you conspiring with Emperor 
Gaz's daughter to gather his remains?!

00:06:52.150 --> 00:06:54.100
We're not conspiring. It's our objective.

00:06:54.510 --> 00:06:57.040
Her objective is my objective.

00:07:08.540 --> 00:07:10.740
Have you guys lost your edge?

00:07:11.380 --> 00:07:13.780
Looks like the battle is finished over there.

00:07:14.930 --> 00:07:19.200
Sadly, I don't think you'll be 
able to take the remains from me.

00:07:19.930 --> 00:07:21.460
Blow away! The Blow!

00:07:36.810 --> 00:07:38.370
What are you afraid of?

00:07:39.010 --> 00:07:42.350
I told you at the start 
that I would fight you,

00:07:42.350 --> 00:07:43.900
but not to the death.

00:07:45.390 --> 00:07:46.940
Total defeat.

00:07:47.300 --> 00:07:50.750
Despite appearances, 
I was once called a hero.

00:07:50.750 --> 00:07:53.180
I have far more experience than you.

00:07:53.550 --> 00:07:54.200
Yes...

00:07:55.010 --> 00:07:58.480
And did you two win your fight? Impressive!

00:07:58.790 --> 00:08:00.620
You took us far too lightly.

00:08:02.030 --> 00:08:05.570
One win, one loss. I guess it's a draw today.

00:08:05.840 --> 00:08:07.510
Shall we try again tomorrow?

00:08:08.410 --> 00:08:10.130
Rematch, gladly!

00:08:18.800 --> 00:08:20.970
Toru! Akari! Try, recommended!

00:08:21.700 --> 00:08:23.510
Huh? You're...

00:08:23.940 --> 00:08:25.680
I apologize for before.

00:08:26.950 --> 00:08:28.230
Mm, s'good.

00:08:28.230 --> 00:08:30.670
We can't do business with this.

00:08:30.670 --> 00:08:31.510
No good.

00:08:32.390 --> 00:08:34.660
Please check the flavor of this wine.

00:08:35.520 --> 00:08:38.790
She owns a vineyard and even a winery...

00:08:39.180 --> 00:08:41.640
Definitely someone I would 
call a success in life.

00:08:43.350 --> 00:08:44.560
The grapes are delicious.

00:08:44.560 --> 00:08:47.330
So both her life and her 
grapes are top notch...

00:08:47.330 --> 00:08:49.280
Brother, are you jealous?

00:08:49.660 --> 00:08:50.660
Not really.

00:08:50.660 --> 00:08:52.050
I am.

00:08:52.370 --> 00:08:54.660
Looking at you makes me 
think about various things,

00:08:54.660 --> 00:08:56.360
and I've come to the conclusion

00:08:56.360 --> 00:08:59.160
that nothing beats having 
money and a good home.

00:08:59.160 --> 00:09:00.620
Well, sorry.

00:09:00.620 --> 00:09:03.690
Just look at how lively she is.

00:09:03.980 --> 00:09:06.350
Yeah... Is she really a hero?

00:09:06.770 --> 00:09:08.720
Unknown person, not lie.

00:09:08.720 --> 00:09:11.500
But maybe not all people who 
have remains are heroes...

00:09:11.500 --> 00:09:15.090
Lady Claudia is indeed 
one of the eight heroes,

00:09:15.090 --> 00:09:18.410
but that is now a thing of the past.

00:09:18.410 --> 00:09:23.290
Now, she is busy every day 
with managing this winery.

00:09:23.590 --> 00:09:27.170
When soldiers were left without 
purpose after the war,

00:09:27.170 --> 00:09:32.500
she offered work to people everywhere 
who had lost their jobs.

00:09:32.760 --> 00:09:35.310
She is a truly benevolent woman.

00:09:36.800 --> 00:09:41.530
So even if you show up and challenge 
her to a fight for the remains...

00:09:41.880 --> 00:09:47.030
Besides, that is like a badge 
of honor to Lady Claudia.

00:09:47.290 --> 00:09:48.280
Nuisance?

00:09:48.570 --> 00:09:49.710
It is a nuisance, yes.

00:09:49.710 --> 00:09:51.480
That's not a badge of honor,

00:09:51.840 --> 00:09:53.210
and you're not a nuisance.

00:09:54.490 --> 00:09:57.900
In fact, I was the one who proposed we fight.

00:09:58.380 --> 00:10:00.190
This has a good acidic quality.

00:10:00.710 --> 00:10:01.490
Well done.

00:10:02.550 --> 00:10:04.770
You can harvest the south vineyard now.

00:10:04.770 --> 00:10:07.860
The north isn't ready yet. 
It'll need a few more days.

00:10:07.860 --> 00:10:08.670
Yes, ma'am.

00:10:09.460 --> 00:10:11.740
As you can see, I'm quite busy.

00:10:12.140 --> 00:10:14.800
So I think tomorrow's fight 
should have a time limit.

00:10:15.030 --> 00:10:19.260
If the three of you can score 
even one victory against me

00:10:19.260 --> 00:10:21.410
in the time period between breakfast and tea,

00:10:21.410 --> 00:10:23.010
you win.

00:10:23.490 --> 00:10:24.260
How's that?

00:10:24.260 --> 00:10:25.380
Understood!

00:10:28.560 --> 00:10:31.670
Still, I had heard that girls

00:10:31.670 --> 00:10:35.430
calling themselves Chaika were 
gathering Emperor Gaz's remains,

00:10:35.430 --> 00:10:37.780
but I didn't expect one to come to me.

00:10:39.290 --> 00:10:42.010
The remains possess immense magic fuel.

00:10:42.390 --> 00:10:43.330
You know that, right?

00:10:43.630 --> 00:10:45.380
Some say the Chaikas intend

00:10:45.380 --> 00:10:47.080
to avenge their father by attacking the

00:10:47.080 --> 00:10:49.960
Alliance of the Six Nations with 
a weapon made using the remains.

00:10:50.740 --> 00:10:52.290
And you have them in there?

00:10:52.800 --> 00:10:55.550
Yes. Already found several.

00:10:56.020 --> 00:10:58.310
What do you intend to do with them?

00:10:58.310 --> 00:10:59.720
Father, funeral.

00:11:00.320 --> 00:11:02.480
I see. If you're his daughter,

00:11:02.480 --> 00:11:05.260
I can understand why you'd want to do that.

00:11:05.260 --> 00:11:07.270
What was Father like in end?

00:11:10.470 --> 00:11:12.810
I don't know what his last moments were like.

00:11:13.310 --> 00:11:15.760
I was tending to my injured companions.

00:11:16.710 --> 00:11:18.080
You didn't see him?

00:11:18.430 --> 00:11:22.530
I did, but it was the captain of our 
punitive force who finished him.

00:11:23.090 --> 00:11:27.580
He was supposed to have beheaded 
the emperor's daughter then, too...

00:11:28.750 --> 00:11:31.830
Then, perhaps the girl he killed was a fake?

00:11:32.270 --> 00:11:34.720
Real one, me...

00:11:36.930 --> 00:11:39.840
Oh, yes. I'll give you some good advice.

00:11:40.230 --> 00:11:44.240
Your magic focuses on attacks, 
but neglects defense.

00:11:44.700 --> 00:11:46.680
You need to defend yourself better.

00:11:46.680 --> 00:11:47.530
Right...

00:11:47.830 --> 00:11:50.700
And your incantations are too long.

00:11:51.870 --> 00:11:54.240
If you can choose only the necessary words,

00:11:54.240 --> 00:11:56.980
a short incantation is 
enough to invoke magic.

00:11:57.930 --> 00:11:59.360
Appreciate advice.

00:11:59.360 --> 00:12:00.740
Need more work.

00:12:01.130 --> 00:12:04.070
It's hard for me to react 
to such open gratitude...

00:12:04.070 --> 00:12:05.640
Oh, would you like some wine?

00:12:06.740 --> 00:12:09.040
We'll pass. We have tomorrow to think about.

00:12:09.370 --> 00:12:11.900
Oh, that's too bad. It's delicious.

00:12:12.530 --> 00:12:13.300
Delicious?

00:12:13.730 --> 00:12:14.950
One glass, please!

00:12:14.950 --> 00:12:15.960
Don't you dare!

00:12:28.530 --> 00:12:30.350
So we have until tomorrow afternoon...

00:12:31.040 --> 00:12:32.600
That's less time than it seems like.

00:12:33.080 --> 00:12:36.810
She told us to take her three-on-one, 
like we were a joke...

00:12:37.530 --> 00:12:41.540
Akari, we need to have a solid plan 
in place, or we'll be in trouble.

00:12:43.780 --> 00:12:44.940
What are you doing?

00:12:45.800 --> 00:12:48.300
Claudia is a hero, and a powerful wizard.

00:12:48.800 --> 00:12:52.280
All the vineyard workers, 
including her butler and secretary,

00:12:52.280 --> 00:12:54.190
are strong ex-soldiers.

00:12:54.190 --> 00:12:54.750
Yeah.

00:12:55.040 --> 00:13:00.000
Which means we must spend this night 
in the palm of our enemy's hand.

00:13:00.780 --> 00:13:02.630
You must be terribly worried.

00:13:03.060 --> 00:13:04.700
But there's no need for concern.

00:13:04.700 --> 00:13:08.370
I will rest close to your side tonight.

00:13:10.650 --> 00:13:11.930
Oh... Sorry.

00:13:18.820 --> 00:13:19.740
What's wrong?

00:13:19.740 --> 00:13:21.780
Incantation shortening, problem.

00:13:22.120 --> 00:13:25.620
That's true... Her incantations 
were really short.

00:13:25.620 --> 00:13:27.970
Is that a skill born of experience?

00:13:28.410 --> 00:13:29.160
Yes.

00:13:29.500 --> 00:13:32.790
As always, you and I will 
have to buy time, Brother.

00:13:33.100 --> 00:13:34.130
Not enough.

00:13:34.520 --> 00:13:37.220
Claudia, immediately interrupt.

00:13:37.220 --> 00:13:40.090
And if she cuts off our 
movements, it's over, huh?

00:13:40.340 --> 00:13:42.300
So we'll need to set a trap.

00:13:43.790 --> 00:13:45.470
This is taking too long.

00:13:45.470 --> 00:13:46.660
What is?

00:13:47.140 --> 00:13:49.650
If you'd just make a contract with me

00:13:49.650 --> 00:13:52.920
and become a dragoon 
cavalier, you'd win easily!

00:13:52.920 --> 00:13:54.730
That again?

00:13:54.730 --> 00:13:56.240
Ask our employer.

00:13:56.240 --> 00:13:57.230
Well?

00:13:58.830 --> 00:14:00.530
Appreciate sentiment...

00:14:00.530 --> 00:14:04.230
But Claudia's terms, three-on-one fight.

00:14:04.480 --> 00:14:06.660
If you win, what's the problem?

00:14:06.660 --> 00:14:08.530
You want the remains, don't you?

00:14:08.980 --> 00:14:11.210
I keep promise.

00:14:12.740 --> 00:14:14.240
You're so serious.

00:14:14.240 --> 00:14:17.120
And Toru is fixated on staying a saboteur...

00:14:17.120 --> 00:14:18.410
I don't know about you guys.

00:14:18.730 --> 00:14:19.960
I'm not fixated!

00:14:20.390 --> 00:14:23.660
Well, whatever! If you ever 
want to try it, let me know!

00:14:24.250 --> 00:14:29.950
Fredrica, if you were with Claudia 
when the Gaz Empire was subjugated,

00:14:29.950 --> 00:14:32.030
don't you know her weaknesses?

00:14:32.030 --> 00:14:33.420
Nope.

00:14:33.720 --> 00:14:35.890
We were on the same side, 
so I didn't fight her.

00:14:35.890 --> 00:14:37.310
I guess...

00:14:41.960 --> 00:14:42.560
Okay.

00:14:43.120 --> 00:14:46.590
Until tomorrow's rematch, let's practice 
your magic as much as time allows.

00:14:47.520 --> 00:14:48.280
Right!

00:14:49.320 --> 00:14:52.160
So, what do those incantations mean, anyway?

00:14:53.590 --> 00:14:56.990
All things in world have meaning.

00:14:57.680 --> 00:15:00.710
Temperature, humidity, wind, terrain,

00:15:00.710 --> 00:15:03.500
and all other things affect magic.

00:15:04.070 --> 00:15:06.210
Many conditions required to invoke magic.

00:15:06.540 --> 00:15:08.250
Precise incantation necessary.

00:15:08.820 --> 00:15:13.080
In magic fuel, memories of 
living things even after death.

00:15:13.920 --> 00:15:15.430
Through precise incantation,

00:15:16.060 --> 00:15:19.690
wizard's strong feelings can 
extract memories from magic fuel.

00:15:20.400 --> 00:15:23.570
Magic is art of making phenomena appear by

00:15:23.570 --> 00:15:26.690
consuming living things' 
memories and thoughts.

00:15:27.680 --> 00:15:29.090
What do they mean when

00:15:29.090 --> 00:15:32.320
they say Emperor Gaz's remains 
are the most powerful magic fuel?

00:15:32.650 --> 00:15:37.970
Stronger memories and thoughts, 
higher quality magic fuel.

00:15:37.970 --> 00:15:42.290
Father's feelings while 
alive, probably very strong.

00:15:43.950 --> 00:15:46.250
First, try shortening incantations!

00:15:46.670 --> 00:15:48.780
Incantations, many similar words.

00:15:49.070 --> 00:15:50.880
Try revising combinations.

00:15:51.430 --> 00:15:54.340
That sounds really tough.

00:15:54.340 --> 00:15:55.070
Yes.

00:15:55.440 --> 00:15:57.310
What's the most important incantation?

00:15:59.850 --> 00:16:01.090
Wait.

00:16:01.780 --> 00:16:02.650
Looking up.

00:16:03.140 --> 00:16:04.670
Are we gonna get this done in time?

00:16:05.110 --> 00:16:08.130
Lai braga... Iatavi... Kamal al...

00:16:08.130 --> 00:16:11.400
Ifun... Elstel... Rankali... Bunkali...

00:16:11.400 --> 00:16:13.630
Roh... Task... Am... Il...

00:16:16.480 --> 00:16:17.740
Glokka! Tamult!

00:16:25.150 --> 00:16:27.360
Naints... Ahman... Isaka...

00:16:29.110 --> 00:16:30.760
Flakinekt... Trinelil...

00:16:36.420 --> 00:16:37.680
We've got a long road ahead...

00:16:45.820 --> 00:16:48.070
I've read your report.

00:16:48.590 --> 00:16:52.950
Regarding Captain Gillette... 
What actually happened?

00:16:53.460 --> 00:16:54.560
The captain...

00:16:55.430 --> 00:16:57.480
During the floating fortress incident,

00:16:57.480 --> 00:17:00.810
he was trying to save Zita and Vivi, 
who were still inside Soara...

00:17:04.010 --> 00:17:07.290
Wh-What do you think you're doing?

00:17:07.290 --> 00:17:09.880
I will have you delay your 
attack by any means necessary!

00:17:10.480 --> 00:17:12.840
But then the battle began...

00:17:13.250 --> 00:17:14.410
Gillette-sama!

00:17:14.410 --> 00:17:15.510
Run, Leonardo!

00:17:17.070 --> 00:17:19.100
The captain was caught in the blast.

00:17:19.750 --> 00:17:21.770
And when Vivi found out about it...

00:17:21.770 --> 00:17:22.580
You're lying...

00:17:27.300 --> 00:17:28.210
Vivi?!

00:17:31.840 --> 00:17:33.960
She took on an appearance resembling

00:17:33.960 --> 00:17:36.280
Chaika right before your eyes?

00:17:37.060 --> 00:17:38.610
It's ironic.

00:17:38.610 --> 00:17:41.910
Someone pursuing Chaika turned 
into something so like Chaika...

00:17:42.420 --> 00:17:43.620
Why her?

00:17:44.830 --> 00:17:47.120
I looked into her background to see if

00:17:47.120 --> 00:17:49.420
she had any relation to Emperor Gaz, but...

00:17:49.890 --> 00:17:52.980
She said she was an orphan 
raised as an assassin,

00:17:53.400 --> 00:17:56.650
and taken in by a noble family as a guard.

00:17:56.650 --> 00:18:00.140
Yes. Beyond that, her origins are unclear.

00:18:00.750 --> 00:18:04.680
In any case, considering what happened 
with the floating fortresses,

00:18:04.680 --> 00:18:06.950
we can assume the existence 
of Chaika and the

00:18:06.950 --> 00:18:10.560
emperor's remains will bring 
great danger to the continent.

00:18:11.380 --> 00:18:12.590
On that note...

00:18:13.550 --> 00:18:17.220
I would like you all to carry on 
with Nikolai as the new captain,

00:18:17.220 --> 00:18:19.450
and continue the investigation of Chaika.

00:18:21.810 --> 00:18:22.950
Understood.

00:18:23.670 --> 00:18:27.790
But please, let us continue to use 
the name of the Gillette Squad.

00:18:28.870 --> 00:18:29.730
Very well.

00:18:48.850 --> 00:18:49.540
Who are you?

00:18:50.100 --> 00:18:52.860
Guy... is what I call myself.

00:18:53.460 --> 00:18:55.130
It appears you only

00:18:55.130 --> 00:18:57.820
half-transformed into Chaika 
since the others stopped you.

00:18:58.640 --> 00:19:01.240
But there is proof that you are Chaika.

00:19:02.170 --> 00:19:05.610
Stop it! I am not the daughter 
of the taboo emperor!

00:19:06.070 --> 00:19:07.490
You don't want to admit it...

00:19:08.030 --> 00:19:08.960
But it is true.

00:19:09.560 --> 00:19:11.160
Half is enough,

00:19:11.580 --> 00:19:13.580
provided you fulfill your role as Chaika.

00:19:13.910 --> 00:19:14.710
Role?

00:19:15.300 --> 00:19:17.440
To gather the remains of the emperor.

00:19:17.890 --> 00:19:18.970
You know that.

00:19:19.360 --> 00:19:20.600
What does that mean?

00:19:21.000 --> 00:19:22.800
You'll find out once you gather them.

00:19:23.350 --> 00:19:25.460
Just what are you?

00:19:26.130 --> 00:19:27.710
An informant.

00:19:37.340 --> 00:19:38.400
Vivi!

00:19:40.960 --> 00:19:43.020
Vivi, what's wrong?

00:19:44.330 --> 00:19:45.470
I'm...

00:19:46.150 --> 00:19:47.740
not Chaika...

00:19:55.170 --> 00:19:56.010
Chaika.

00:19:58.530 --> 00:20:00.740
Incantation shortening, not successful.

00:20:00.740 --> 00:20:01.880
Very worried.

00:20:01.880 --> 00:20:03.810
Don't think I can win.

00:20:03.810 --> 00:20:05.100
Don't worry.

00:20:05.440 --> 00:20:07.220
We'll get the remains, no matter what.

00:20:07.550 --> 00:20:08.910
Brother is right.

00:20:10.170 --> 00:20:13.900
Even if we lose the fight, 
we know where she keeps the remains.

00:20:14.390 --> 00:20:16.160
If we have to, we'll just steal it.

00:20:17.770 --> 00:20:19.280
Appreciate sentiment.

00:20:19.280 --> 00:20:22.160
But I fight as wizard.

00:20:27.730 --> 00:20:28.570
Ready to go?

00:20:29.260 --> 00:20:30.120
Yes.

00:20:37.560 --> 00:20:41.630
It looked like you were practicing 
magic late into the night.

00:20:41.950 --> 00:20:43.510
Did you have any luck?

00:20:44.040 --> 00:20:45.550
Not successful.

00:20:46.170 --> 00:20:48.530
I see. That's a shame.

00:20:48.980 --> 00:20:51.560
But I fight, full strength!

00:20:51.560 --> 00:20:54.230
And trust Toru and Akari in battle!

00:20:54.550 --> 00:20:58.020
We'll be taking the remains, 
no matter what we have to do.

00:20:58.990 --> 00:21:00.650
Truly the words of a saboteur.

00:21:01.010 --> 00:21:02.800
Toru and Akari, saboteurs.

00:21:02.800 --> 00:21:05.890
Also, both precious to me!

00:21:05.890 --> 00:21:06.710
Oh?

00:21:07.070 --> 00:21:09.240
How nice to have such reliable partners.

00:21:09.730 --> 00:21:10.800
Are you ready?

00:21:10.800 --> 00:21:12.710
All ready!

00:21:13.100 --> 00:21:14.750
Then, shall we begin?

00:21:25.330 --> 00:21:26.470
Furom, iestrov...

00:21:26.900 --> 00:21:27.970
Elmuto... Eril!

00:21:30.460 --> 00:21:31.100
Natow!

00:21:31.420 --> 00:21:33.140
Come, The Shtola!

00:21:35.380 --> 00:21:36.250
What?

00:21:36.250 --> 00:21:38.290
Come, tense atmosphere!

00:21:38.770 --> 00:21:39.980
The Strays!

00:21:39.980 --> 00:21:41.590
Jentol, winsica!

00:23:25.480 --> 00:23:28.270
Claudia's advice, very beneficial.

00:23:28.270 --> 00:23:29.930
I spare no effort!

00:23:30.840 --> 00:23:32.660
This manor, full of grapes!

00:23:32.660 --> 00:23:36.470
Cakes, cookies, tarts... 
Want to stay forever!

00:23:36.470 --> 00:23:40.250
A Wizard's Pride

00:23:37.070 --> 00:23:39.200
Next time: "A Wizard's Pride."
